# Workflow orchestrator (chief-delegated)

telegram-medical-channels uses **chief agent** (coordination) above **workflow orchestrator** (ship bar). Parent agents spawn **chief first**; chief delegates orchestrator cycles. Orchestrator **does not** spawn chief.

## Autonomous operations

The user does **not** invoke orchestrator manually each session. **Chief** (hooks + `chief-agent-always.mdc`) assigns orchestrator when git/PR/CI/merge work is needed.

## Session start

For the top-level parent only: after orienting, if dirty `git status`, open `gh pr list`, recent subagent transcripts, or multiple `agent/*` branches — **spawn or resume chief** (not orchestrator directly) unless chief waived in writing:

```
Task: generalPurpose, run_in_background=true
Prompt: .cursor/skills/chief-agent/SKILL.md — SCAN -> LOCK CHECK -> PLAN -> DELEGATE; delegate ship bar to workflow-orchestrator when needed.
```

## After substantive subagent work

When a Task subagent returns after implementation, discovery, scrape, registry, workbook, docs, PR babysit, or orchestrator cycle:

1. The top-level parent spawns or resumes **chief** unless chief ran in the last **5 minutes**.
2. Chief re-scans locks and delegates **one** orchestrator cycle or path owner per queue item.
3. When executing orchestrator this turn (chief delegation only), follow `.cursor/skills/workflow-orchestrator/SKILL.md`.

An active chief continues its existing cycle. A chief-delegated orchestrator or domain worker returns findings to its assigning chief; neither spawns another chief.

## One PR per task (hard)

- Do **not** bundle discovery + scrape + registry + workbook + unrelated fixes in one PR.
- Meta `.cursor/` / `AGENTS.md` / hooks plumbing -> `agent/workflow-orchestrator-*` or `agent/auto-chief-*` branch only.
- Uncommitted work -> partitioned PRs on `agent/<slug>`; **never** routine direct commits to `main`.

## Manual invoke (optional)

**"run workflow orchestrator"** — read `.cursor/skills/workflow-orchestrator/SKILL.md`. Chief may have already delegated.

## Hooks

`sessionStart` / `subagentStop` / `stop` inject chief-first follow-up via `.cursor/hooks/orchestrator-remind.mjs`. Signal to run **chief**, not to skip `WORKFLOW.md`.

## Ship bar unchanged

Orchestrator does **not** waive `WORKFLOW.md` steps 5-7, bot wait, thread closure, or `npm run verify:local`.